+## Coupling outside this directory
+
+`ai-trading/deploy/upstream/vibe-trading/start-vibe.py` imports
+`LLM_PROVIDER_BY_NAME`, `_discover_reasoning_efforts` and
+`_desktop_secure_credential_names` from `src.api.settings_routes`. At container
+start it drops a configured `LANGCHAIN_REASONING_EFFORT` that the configured model
+rejects (so a Firestore model/effort mismatch degrades to the model default instead
+of failing every run). A sync that renames those names breaks container start:
+check them first.
+
+`.github/dependabot.yml` ignores this submodule. Without that, Dependabot would
+propose moving the pin to the fork's stale `main` and drop every change above.
+
+## Behaviour to preserve through a sync
+
+1. For direct OpenAI, the Settings picker lists only what the selected model accepts
+   (the live probe), and `PUT /settings/llm` refuses anything else.
+2. `gpt-6.1-sol` is the OpenAI default everywhere (`llm_providers.json`, both CLIs).
+ 3. No temperature, QVeris or China-credential controls in Settings, and the four
+    China-only markets are not editable.
+ 4. A completed analysis is never replaced by the canned stub for figure-level
+    issues. Declared figures the checker cannot verify are kept with
+    `(unverified※)` and a footnote. A `proposed` level, every failing figure
+    of a draft with no figures block, a misattributed figure and any unknown
+    reason are cut. Identity findings and market answers without observed
+    prices still release nothing.
+ 5. A currency-marked figure may cite one exact money-valued field in
+    `_EXACT_REF_MONEY_LEAVES`. A pooled tool/call ref, ratio, return or count
+    cannot ground a money figure.
+ 6. No Jina calls: `read_url` stays unavailable in local and MCP catalogs;
+    its compatibility function returns an error without HTTP. Bundled skills
+    and swarm presets must not instruct agents to use it. A new full-page
+    reader requires a separately approved SSRF-safe design.
+ 7. A chat message may specify optional `reasoning_effort`, checked against
+    the configured model before any message or attempt is stored. It applies
+    only to that run and its committee workers; no server default is changed.
+ 8. Settings and chat offer only levels confirmed by a model-specific provider
+    error. A generic supported-values list is inconclusive, so the picker
+    falls back conservatively and cannot promise that every manually crafted
+    request will be accepted.
+  9. An existing chat with no active research goal returns 200 JSON null from
+     the optional-goal endpoint; a nonexistent chat still returns 404. The
+     frontend treats null as absence and surfaces a real 404.
+ 10. The US committee's typed disposition binds to the generated run ID, exact
+     ticker, current Finnhub/Yahoo counts and successful evidence; its server
+     target uses filed SEC EPS and proven no-split USD quote basis. Missing
+     proof produces analysis-only or, for target-only gaps, a verdict without
+     an own numeric target.
+ 11. US-stock chat text and reasoning tails wait for the policy release, while
+     safe progress can stream; no raw committee event, trace sidecar or
+     checkpoint may expose a draft. An incomplete, stale or unavailable source
+     yields analysis-only, never an own Buy/Sell/target.
+
+## Reapplying after a sync
+
+```
+git remote add upstream https://github.com/HKUDS/Vibe-Trading.git   # once
+git fetch upstream
+git merge upstream/main            # on branch family-app; never force-push
+```
+
+Expect conflicts in `Settings.tsx`, `Agent.tsx`, `settings_routes.py`,
+`sessions_routes.py`, `service.py`, `llm.py`, `chat.py`, `swarm/runtime.py`,
+`swarm/worker.py`, `api.ts`, locale JSON files, the grounding package
+(`release.py`, `policies.py`, `evidence.py`, `figures.py`), `loop.py`,
+`context.py`, `web_reader_tool.py`, `web_search_tool.py`, `mcp_server.py`,
+bundled skill docs and swarm presets. Resolve in favour of
+upstream's structure, then restore the behaviours above and rerun the live
+check in `ai-trading/plans/subplans/01o-vibe-answer-integrity.md` section 7;
+upstream may have repaired some of these false rejections already. Then:
+
+```
+cd agent && python -m pytest tests -q           # whole suite
+cd frontend && npx tsc -b && npx vitest run && npm run build
+```
+
+Update the table below, push `family-app` to `origin` (no force), re-run the
+reachability and `DIVERGENCE.md` checks in the sync skill, then move the gitlink.
+
+To drop the fork: point `.gitmodules` back at HKUDS, pin an upstream commit, remove
+the `start-vibe.py` guard and its imports, and delete this file.
